# What a build from the repository's root is sent (#1381): Go/ and Web/ only, so a
# checkout's builds, worktrees and node_modules never go to the builder. The same as
# deploy/Containerfile.dockerignore, for a builder that reads only this one (the legacy one).
*
!Go/
!Web/
Go/out/
Web/node_modules/
Web/dist/
